===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# {{sid|en|Q221}}{{lb|en|historical}} {{place|en|@acronym of:former Yugoslav Republic of Macedonia|@former long form of:North Macedonia|country|r/Southeast Europe|*on the [[Balkan Peninsula]]}}.

====Usage notes====
Although the word "former" is intentionally not capitalized, as it is a "provisional designator" and not the title for the state, the acronym "FYROM" is often used.

